1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:05,063
Rush hour. Har table bhara hua. Waiter ek, orders das.

2
00:00:05,363 --> 00:00:09,337
Galat order. Late bill. Aur naraaz customer.

3
00:00:09,637 --> 00:00:13,612
Problem aapki kitchen mein nahi hai. Problem system mein hai.

4
00:00:14,561 --> 00:00:17,010
Pesh hai — menu.irad.solutions.

5
00:00:17,310 --> 00:00:21,252
Digital menu, table se ordering, aur kitchen printing — sab ek jagah.

6
00:00:21,552 --> 00:00:23,976
Aur customer ko koi app download nahi karni.

7
00:00:24,926 --> 00:00:27,525
Pehle dekhte hain, poora restaurant kaise chalta hai.

8
00:00:28,475 --> 00:00:30,368
Shuruaat hoti hai aapke menu se.

9
00:00:30,668 --> 00:00:34,645
Sections banaiye, dishes daaliye, variants aur prices set kijiye.

10
00:00:34,945 --> 00:00:39,699
Save karte hi menu live. Jo aap dekhte hain, wahi customer dekhta hai.

11
00:00:40,649 --> 00:00:45,186
Design aapke brand ke hisaab se. Layout, colour, font — aap chuniye.

12
00:00:45,486 --> 00:00:49,839
Phone preview saath-saath badalta hai. Koi designer nahi chahiye.

13
00:00:50,789 --> 00:00:55,208
Har table ka apna QR card. Download kijiye aur print kijiye.

14
00:00:55,508 --> 00:00:58,544
Ya PVC cards aur acrylic stands humse mangwaaiye.

15
00:00:58,844 --> 00:01:03,590
QR kabhi expire nahi hota. Naam badle, tab bhi card chalta rahega.

16
00:01:04,540 --> 00:01:06,095
Ab customer ki taraf se dekhiye.

17
00:01:06,395 --> 00:01:11,349
Table pe baithe, QR scan kiya — menu khul gaya. Na app, na login.

18
00:01:11,649 --> 00:01:15,354
Dish chuni, 'Place order' dabaya. Order seedha kitchen tak.

19
00:01:16,304 --> 00:01:19,631
Baad mein kuch aur chahiye? Ek aur filter coffee?

20
00:01:19,931 --> 00:01:25,406
Customer wahin se naya round jodta hai. Pehla order jaisa tha, waisa rehta hai.

21
00:01:25,706 --> 00:01:27,794
Waiter ko awaaz dene ki zaroorat hi nahi.

22
00:01:28,744 --> 00:01:31,227
Aur aapke counter pe — live orders board.

23
00:01:31,527 --> 00:01:35,730
New, Being made, Ready. Har table, har round, ek nazar mein.

24
00:01:36,030 --> 00:01:42,263
Jo table dobara order karta hai, woh 'running' banke sabse upar aata hai. Kuch miss nahi hota.

25
00:01:43,213 --> 00:01:44,962
Kitchen staff ka apna alag login.

26
00:01:45,262 --> 00:01:48,888
Woh order accept karte hain, preparing aur ready mark karte hain.

27
00:01:49,188 --> 00:01:52,382
Lekin prices, bills aur paise — sirf owner dekhta hai.

28
00:01:53,332 --> 00:01:56,058
Khaana khatam. Aap table close karte hain.

29
00:01:56,358 --> 00:01:59,203
Bill customer ke phone pe — tax ke saath, saaf-saaf.

30
00:01:59,503 --> 00:02:03,972
Service charge optional hai. Customer chahe toh hata sakta hai.

31
00:02:04,922 --> 00:02:06,822
Saath mein ek sawaal: khaana kaisa tha?

32
00:02:07,122 --> 00:02:11,219
Customer Google review de sakta hai — aur ek private message, seedha aapko.

33
00:02:11,519 --> 00:02:14,573
Jo baat aapko jaanni chahiye, woh aap tak pahunchti hai.

34
00:02:15,523 --> 00:02:17,247
Aur din ke end mein — poora hisaab.

35
00:02:17,547 --> 00:02:23,257
Har bill. Cash, UPI, card. Aaj, is hafte, ya poora financial year.

36
00:02:23,557 --> 00:02:27,178
Export kijiye, apne CA ko bhej dijiye. Bas.

37
00:02:28,128 --> 00:02:30,865
Ab baat karte hain kitchen ki. Printing.

38
00:02:31,815 --> 00:02:36,566
Aapke counter ka koi bhi computer. Chrome kholiye — wahi aapka print station.

39
00:02:36,866 --> 00:02:41,798
Thermal printer jodiye — 58 ya 80 mm. Koi special software nahi.

40
00:02:42,098 --> 00:02:44,326
Phir bataiye, kaunsa printer kya chhaapega.

41
00:02:45,276 --> 00:02:47,745
Teen kaam hain: token, kitchen ticket, aur bill.

42
00:02:48,045 --> 00:02:51,818
Chhota restaurant? Ek hi computer teenon kaam kar leta hai.

43
00:02:52,118 --> 00:02:57,996
Bada setup? Counter pe token aur bill, kitchen mein KOT. Aap decide kijiye.

44
00:02:58,946 --> 00:03:02,234
Jaise hi order accept hota hai, do cheezein print hoti hain.

45
00:03:02,534 --> 00:03:05,490
Customer ke liye token slip — bade token number ke saath.

46
00:03:05,790 --> 00:03:10,302
Aur kitchen ke liye KOT — sirf dishes aur instructions, jaise 'less spicy'.

47
00:03:10,602 --> 00:03:14,270
Token number dono pe same. Confusion ka sawaal hi nahi.

48
00:03:15,220 --> 00:03:16,892
Customer ne baad mein chai mangwaayi?

49
00:03:17,192 --> 00:03:20,746
Kitchen ko sirf naye items jaate hain — 'Round 2, new items'.

50
00:03:21,046 --> 00:03:23,450
Pehle round ka kuch bhi dobara print nahi hota.

51
00:03:24,400 --> 00:03:26,850
Table close hote hi — poore order ka ek bill.

52
00:03:27,150 --> 00:03:31,496
Saare rounds ek saath. Token number ke saath, taaki hisaab mile.

53
00:03:32,446 --> 00:03:35,668
Aur agar printer band ho jaaye? Paper khatam ho jaaye?

54
00:03:35,968 --> 00:03:40,301
Order nahi rukta. Printing ki galti se order kabhi fail nahi hota.

55
00:03:40,601 --> 00:03:47,530
Fail hua print apne aap dobara try hota hai. Screen pe saaf dikhta hai — kitne print hue, kitne fail.

56
00:03:47,830 --> 00:03:51,951
Ek click mein reprint. Aur ek ticket kabhi do baar print nahi hoti.

57
00:03:52,901 --> 00:03:58,037
Owner dashboard se har station dikhta hai — kaunsa online hai, kaunsa printer kis kaam pe.

58
00:03:58,337 --> 00:04:02,004
Test print kijiye, naam badaliye, ya kisi machine ko hata dijiye.

59
00:04:02,954 --> 00:04:06,630
Menu se bill tak. Customer ke phone se kitchen ke printer tak.

60
00:04:06,930 --> 00:04:11,162
Ek system. Shaant. Tez. Bharosemand.

61
00:04:11,462 --> 00:04:15,734
menu.irad.solutions — aapka restaurant, bina shor ke.

